Spock Assistant (github.com/quonn77/spock-assistant)
Copyright 2026 The spock-assistant contributors

An unofficial Spock Framework support plugin for OpenIDEA. Not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or maintained by the Spock Framework project, JetBrains,
or the OpenIDEA project. "Spock" is used only to describe the testing
framework this plugin works with.

The block-structure rules (block names, their order and completeness) and the
specification templates are a clean-room reimplementation in Rust, informed by
Spock IntelliJ Plugin (https://github.com/lobodpav/spock-intellij-plugin,
Apache License 2.0, by Pavel Lobodinsky). Where code or templates of that
project are copied or adapted, the affected files say so in their header.

This product uses the OpenIDEA plugin SDK
(https://github.com/l0ng-ai/openidea, Apache License 2.0).
